1397 (Viktor: «На музыку один CFG, а на лирику - другой»): a third branch, the prompt without its lyrics; logits = U + g_music·(S − U) + g_lyrics·(C − S); request field cfg_lyrics (−1: as cfg_scale, the one guidance as before, two branches). Measured on a test engine: the same seeds part ways at another lyrics scale; about the same time (three rows in one batch).
1399 (Viktor: «нужна полная амбулаторная карта трека»): meta.json "stages": the score's tokens and seconds, the music tokens written and kept with their seconds and the guidance applied, the sound stage and the decoder.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
